Question 5

There are roughly seven billion people in the world today. Which map shows where people live? (Each figure represents 1 billion people.)

gapminder |&gt; 
  filter(year == 2015) |&gt; 
  group_by(continent) |&gt;
  summarize(population_in_billion = sum(population)/10^9) |&gt;
  ggplot(aes(x = continent, y = population_in_billion, fill = continent)) +
  geom_col()

Question 7

What is the gap in life expectancy between Europe and Africa?

gapminder |&gt; 
  filter(year == 2015) |&gt; 
  group_by(continent) |&gt; 
  summarize(expected_life = sum(life_expectancy * population)/sum(population)) |&gt; 
  ggplot(aes(x = continent, y = expected_life)) +
  geom_col()







